+    // value pieces; dodge removal; reset Glen Elendra's persist). Forge blinked opponents' creatures first and its own by
+    // creature value. A blink (exile, back at the next end step) is worth: an own creature's enter trigger run again (a card
+    // back from the graveyard at its own worth, a typecycler more since it tutors again; a search; draws; tokens), a persist
+    // counter cleared, less any of its auras that fall off; an opponent's token (it's gone for good); an opponent's creature
+    // attacking the seat (out of combat). Never the seat's commander (it would go to the command zone). ----
+    static final double BLINK_AT = 60;
