+    // ---- fishpond patch 97: a permanent whose upkeep trigger wins on hand size (Triskaidekaphile: exactly 13) is a closer
+    // once casting it leaves that hand, or leaves less with a pay-life draw on the battlefield to make it up (Necrodominance's
+    // end step; patch 92 sizes that draw), and the hand will keep (its own "no maximum hand size", or a limit at least that).
+    // zurb2nw_20261023 X1 g9: 13+ cards, Necrodominance and Rule of Law out, Triskaidekaphile in hand; the one spell went to
